# dev-test.sh target list - one endpoint per line, whitespace-separated:
#   name  base_url  ssh_host
#
# name      - a short label used in reports and output filenames
# base_url  - the OpenAI-compatible engine's base URL (no trailing slash),
#             reachable directly from wherever dev-test.sh runs
# ssh_host  - passwordless-SSH-reachable host string (user@host) used only
#             for nvidia-smi GPU sampling during a run; the same host the
#             engine itself runs on
#
# The model id is never read from this file - dev-test.sh always resolves
# it live from each endpoint's own GET /v1/models, since that's the only
# way to know exactly what a server-side --served-model-name override (if
# any) actually reports (see PLAN-FLEET_PROMPT_TEST.md D1/D11).
#
# Copy this file to dev-test.targets (gitignored - environment-specific)
# and fill in real values, or pass a different path with --targets FILE.

# spark-1   http://192.168.0.101:8000   developer@192.168.0.101
# spark-2   http://192.168.0.102:8000   developer@192.168.0.102
